- [[hxxps://dataengineeringcentral.substack.com/p/what-happens-when-a-software-engineer][What Happens When a Software Engineer Builds a Company Alone?]] (Data Engineering Central) — кейс создания B2B-продукта в одиночку без венчурного финансирования.
